r templates and member functions. They are not included in the C++ standard documents.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Obtains the underlying iterator contained in <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/concat_view/iterator#it\">it_</a></i></code> ﻿.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get\"><code>std::get</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/concat_view/iterator#it\">it_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Obtains the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">I</span></code>th view in the parent <code>concat_view</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/get\"><code>std::get</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/concat_view/iterator#parent\">parent_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/concat_view#views\">views_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Obtains an iterator to the beginning of the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">I</span></code>th view in the parent <code>concat_view</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span>